295	    /// Advance the peripheral clock by `n` CPU cycles, moving any finished
296	    /// audio half out of RAM (int32 L/R holding a 24-bit sample in the low
297	    /// bits — Felucca writes Q15 << 7, audio.c OUT_SHIFT — so >> 8 to i16).
