/// The 12-bit "composed" immediate used by `R = #h`, the 4-byte
/// register-immediate ALU forms and `[R+#i] op= #h`: a 4-bit `code` and an
/// 8-bit `m`. Fitted on every 4-byte ALU/mov-immediate in the V13 corpus
